WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:04.189
(light ambient music)
(water bubbling)

00:00:04.189 --> 00:00:07.335
- [Man] The free diver to me is a pioneer.

00:00:07.335 --> 00:00:11.322
We're all experimenting in
something that has not been

00:00:11.322 --> 00:00:14.366
the main thrust of humanity until now.

00:00:14.366 --> 00:00:17.533
(light ambient music)

00:00:21.348 --> 00:00:23.318
My name is Aharon Solomons.

00:00:23.318 --> 00:00:26.696
I'm a free dive
instructor-trainer from Edah.

00:00:26.696 --> 00:00:29.433
I specialize in coaching athletes who want

00:00:29.433 --> 00:00:32.766
to do national records or world records.

00:00:34.496 --> 00:00:37.441
You've got to kick in your dive reflexes,

00:00:37.441 --> 00:00:40.286
breathe up a little bit, uh, breathing,

00:00:40.286 --> 00:00:44.286
about as you'd do just
before you went to sleep.

00:00:45.369 --> 00:00:48.619
Then one big breath, turn over, and go.

00:00:55.099 --> 00:00:58.424
From the moment that you leave the surface,

00:00:58.424 --> 00:01:01.153
the blood is beginning
to leave the peripheries

00:01:01.153 --> 00:01:05.070
and migrate towards the
so-called noble organs.

00:01:06.773 --> 00:01:10.190
Then you start to sink faster and faster.

00:01:15.691 --> 00:01:18.584
Once you're free falling,
it's pure pleasure.

00:01:18.584 --> 00:01:22.251
It's an incredible
sensation of restfulness.

00:01:29.938 --> 00:01:33.160
You're going down, and the colors change.

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:36.560
You go down from a clear blue hue

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:40.143
to a darker blue, and
to a purple twilight.

00:01:43.474 --> 00:01:46.256
And then finally into total blackness.

00:01:46.256 --> 00:01:48.417
(music stops)
And then we have

00:01:48.417 --> 00:01:50.888
a rude awakening, we hit the plate,

00:01:50.888 --> 00:01:53.299
and then we turn 'round
and we have to work

00:01:53.299 --> 00:01:56.627
a bit harder coming
up, and as you come up,

00:01:56.627 --> 00:02:00.794
you're working less hard,
because buoyancy is returning,

00:02:02.762 --> 00:02:04.737
and then it's like a rebirth,

00:02:04.737 --> 00:02:07.053
you're coming back into the light.

00:02:07.053 --> 00:02:09.472
The whole process is one of pleasure,

00:02:09.472 --> 00:02:13.280
and of terrific sense of
adventure and achievement.

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:15.806
Usually changes some switches.

00:02:15.806 --> 00:02:19.117
All the things that I
thought were impossible,

00:02:19.117 --> 00:02:20.801
all the things that I thought

00:02:20.801 --> 00:02:23.384
were not achievable by me, are.

00:02:24.491 --> 00:02:28.073
If that's achievable, what
else isn't achievable?

00:02:28.073 --> 00:02:31.734
And that opens a whole Pandora's box.

00:02:31.734 --> 00:02:35.152
So it's quite an experience, free diving.

00:02:35.152 --> 00:02:38.402
(light ambient music)

